<!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
<section class="sec" id="how-it-works" aria-label="How the process works">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="slbl rv">The Process</p>
    <h2 class="sh2 rv">Three Simple Steps to<br>Your Cash Offer</h2>
    <p class="ssub rv">No open houses. No waiting on bank financing. No repairs. Just a straightforward path from where you are today to cash in your hand.</p>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step rv">
        <div class="snum">01</div>
        <div class="sico"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 6.75c0 8.284 6.716 15 15 15h2.25a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25v-1.372c0-.516-.351-.966-.852-1.091l-4.423-1.106c-.44-.11-.902.055-1.173.417l-.97 1.293c-.282.376-.769.542-1.21.38a12.035 12.035 0 01-7.143-7.143c-.162-.441.004-.928.38-1.21l1.293-.97c.363-.271.527-.734.417-1.173L6.963 3.102a1.125 1.125 0 00-1.091-.852H4.5A2.25 2.25 0 002.25 4.5v2.25z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Tell Us About Your Property</h3>
        <p>Fill out the short form above or give us a call. Tell us your situation — there's no judgment here. The more we understand, the better we can help you find the right path forward.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step rv">
        <div class="snum">02</div>
        <div class="sico"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 12l8.954-8.955c.44-.439 1.152-.439 1.591 0L21.75 12M4.5 9.75v10.125c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125H9.75v-4.875c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125V21h4.125c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V9.75M8.25 21h8.25"/></svg></div>
        <h3>We Come See the Property</h3>
        <p>We schedule a quick walkthrough at a time that works for you. No cleaning, no repairs, no staging. We look at it as-is and come prepared to make a fair offer on the spot.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step rv">
        <div class="snum">03</div>
        <div class="sico"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 18.75a60.07 60.07 0 0115.797 2.101c.727.198 1.453-.342 1.453-1.096V18.75M3.75 4.5v.75A.75.75 0 013 6h-.75m0 0v-.375c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125H20.25M2.25 6v9m18-10.5v.75c0 .414.336.75.75.75h.75m-1.5-1.5h.375c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v9.75c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-.375m1.5-1.5H21a.75.75 0 00-.75.75v.75m0 0H3.75m0 0h-.375a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V15m1.5 1.5v-.75A.75.75 0 003 15h-.75M15 10.5a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm3 0h.008v.008H18V10.5zm-12 0h.008v.008H6V10.5z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>You Choose the Closing Date</h3>
        <p>If our offer works for you, we move forward on your timeline — as fast as 7 days or whenever you need. We close through a licensed title company. You get cash. Done.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SITUATIONS -->
<section class="sec sec-dk" id="situations" aria-label="Situations we help with">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="slbl rv">Every Situation Welcome</p>
    <h2 class="sh2 lt rv">We Help When Things<br>Get Complicated</h2>
    <p class="ssub lt rv">Life doesn't follow a script. Whatever is going on with your property — we've seen it before and we know how to help you find a way through it.</p>
    <div class="sits">
      <div class="sit rv"><span class="sit-ico">🏚️</span><h3>Facing Foreclosure</h3><p>If you're behind on payments and the bank has started the foreclosure process, a fast cash sale can stop it — and potentially let you walk away with money instead of losing everything.</p></div>
      <div class="sit rv"><span class="sit-ico">📋</span><h3>Behind on Property Taxes</h3><p>Years of unpaid taxes can feel like a hole you can't climb out of. Back taxes can often be resolved directly from sale proceeds — you don't need to pay anything upfront.</p></div>
      <div class="sit rv"><span class="sit-ico">⚖️</span><h3>Inherited Property or Probate</h3><p>Inheriting a house you didn't plan for — especially one in probate or needing work — is stressful. We work with estates and heirs regularly at whatever pace the process requires.</p></div>
      <div class="sit rv"><span class="sit-ico">💔</span><h3>Going Through Divorce</h3><p>When you need to divide assets and move forward, a quick clean sale removes a major source of conflict and puts cash in both parties' hands without the delays of a listing.</p></div>
      <div class="sit rv"><span class="sit-ico">🔨</span><h3>Property Needs Major Repairs</h3><p>Foundation issues, roof problems, fire damage, mold — we buy in any condition. You don't spend a dollar on repairs. We take the property exactly as it sits today.</p></div>
      <div class="sit rv"><span class="sit-ico">🏠</span><h3>Tired Landlord</h3><p>Done dealing with difficult tenants and maintenance headaches? We buy rental properties — occupied or vacant — and let you step away from the stress permanently.</p></div>
      <div class="sit rv"><span class="sit-ico">📦</span><h3>Relocating Quickly</h3><p>Job transfer, family situation, or just ready for a fresh start — when you need to move fast, a traditional sale is too slow. We can close before you have to leave.</p></div>
      <div class="sit rv"><span class="sit-ico">🔒</span><h3>Vacant or Abandoned Property</h3><p>A vacant property drains money and attracts problems. Whether it's been sitting empty for months or years, we can take it off your hands quickly regardless of condition.</p></div>
      <div class="sit rv"><span class="sit-ico">💡</span><h3>Something Else Entirely</h3><p>Every situation is different. If yours doesn't fit neatly into any of the above — reach out anyway. There are more options available than most people realize.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- COMPARE -->
