          <div class="crow"><svg class="cb" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zM8.28 7.22a.75.75 0 00-1.06 1.06L8.94 10l-1.72 1.72a.75.75 0 101.06 1.06L10 11.06l1.72 1.72a.75.75 0 101.06-1.06L11.06 10l1.72-1.72a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06L10 8.94 8.28 7.22z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>5–6% agent commission off the top</div>
          <div class="crow"><svg class="cb" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zM8.28 7.22a.75.75 0 00-1.06 1.06L8.94 10l-1.72 1.72a.75.75 0 101.06 1.06L10 11.06l1.72 1.72a.75.75 0 101.06-1.06L11.06 10l1.72-1.72a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06L10 8.94 8.28 7.22z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Closing costs typically 2–3%</div>
          <div class="crow"><svg class="cb" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zM8.28 7.22a.75.75 0 00-1.06 1.06L8.94 10l-1.72 1.72a.75.75 0 101.06 1.06L10 11.06l1.72 1.72a.75.75 0 101.06-1.06L11.06 10l1.72-1.72a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06L10 8.94 8.28 7.22z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Buyers may request repairs or credits</div>
          <div class="crow"><svg class="cb" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zM8.28 7.22a.75.75 0 00-1.06 1.06L8.94 10l-1.72 1.72a.75.75 0 101.06 1.06L10 11.06l1.72 1.72a.75.75 0 101.06-1.06L11.06 10l1.72-1.72a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06L10 8.94 8.28 7.22z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Open houses and strangers in your home</div>
          <div class="crow"><svg class="cb" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zM8.28 7.22a.75.75 0 00-1.06 1.06L8.94 10l-1.72 1.72a.75.75 0 101.06 1.06L10 11.06l1.72 1.72a.75.75 0 101.06-1.06L11.06 10l1.72-1.72a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06L10 8.94 8.28 7.22z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Sale can fall through due to financing</div>
          <div class="crow"><svg class="cb" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zM8.28 7.22a.75.75 0 00-1.06 1.06L8.94 10l-1.72 1.72a.75.75 0 101.06 1.06L10 11.06l1.72 1.72a.75.75 0 101.06-1.06L11.06 10l1.72-1.72a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06L10 8.94 8.28 7.22z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Closing date set by buyer's lender</div>
          <div class="crow"><svg class="cb" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zM8.28 7.22a.75.75 0 00-1.06 1.06L8.94 10l-1.72 1.72a.75.75 0 101.06 1.06L10 11.06l1.72 1.72a.75.75 0 101.06-1.06L11.06 10l1.72-1.72a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06L10 8.94 8.28 7.22z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Property must be listed and market-ready</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- TESTIMONIALS -->
<section class="sec sec-alt" aria-label="Customer testimonials">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="slbl rv">Real Stories</p>
    <h2 class="sh2 rv">DFW Homeowners We've Helped</h2>
    <p class="ssub rv">These are real situations from real people across the Metroplex who needed a way out and found one.</p>
    <div class="tms">
      <div class="tm rv">
        <p class="tm-txt">I was three months behind on my mortgage and terrified about losing the house. They came out, made me a fair offer the same day, and we closed in 11 days. I walked away with enough to start over. Can't say enough good things.</p>
        <div class="tm-au"><div class="av">M</div><div><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><div class="aname">Marcus T.</div><div class="acity">Garland, TX</div></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="tm rv">
        <p class="tm-txt">My mother passed and left me a house in Mesquite that needed a ton of work. I live out of state and had no idea what to do. They handled everything, explained every step, and were incredibly patient with the probate process.</p>
        <div class="tm-au"><div class="av">D</div><div><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><div class="aname">Denise R.</div><div class="acity">Mesquite, TX</div></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="tm rv">
        <p class="tm-txt">Going through a divorce is hard enough without fighting over a house. Having someone who could give us a fair cash price and close fast made the whole thing so much less painful. Professional, understanding, and quick.</p>
        <div class="tm-au"><div class="av">J</div><div><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><div class="aname">James & Linda W.</div><div class="acity">Irving, TX</div></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

